    22506                           "You are Jet Bradley, a young engineer working for ENCOM. Moments ago you were in your father's lab when, without warning, Ma3a digitized you into the computer. You must learn to defend yourself using your disc if you are to survive the system.\n\nFollow Byte's instructions. Ma3a has sent him to help you."
