    22508                           "A severe virus is sweeping through the system and is advancing towards Ma3a's primary server. She is in grave danger, jeopardizing your only ticket home. You must find transportation from this secured terminal to her server before it's too late.\n\nYou are not alone. Mercury and Byte are working with you, follow their direction."
    22509                           "Use the weapon select keys (Default keys: 1-4) to access your weapons. Use the Block/Recall button (Default key: RMB) to perform a disc Power Block capable of sending a powerful blast of energy back towards the enemy."
