STRINGTABLE DISCARDABLE
BEGIN
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10387              "Jet, I've been thinking. My User's original instructions were to free Ma3a from her processing dock, not to combat the corruption."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10388              "Your User must have recognized the futility of confronting such an aggressive virus."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10389              "We need to find Byte."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10390              "Jet, we should split up."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10391              "Attention all server applications. We've been under attack by an unknown virus. The corruption has infected the operating system, and multiple threads are failing. In a few moments, it will breach my docking protocols. "
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10392              "This is my final transmission. End of line."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10393              "Alright scripts, we're pulling out! The Kernel has ordered a complete system reformat."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10395              "Another system reformat?  Great."
