    IDS_DIALOGUE_10474              "Ma3a ... (garbled) ... you're still intact ...  (garbled) ... sorry about revealing ... (garbled) ... correction ... (garbled) ... I had no choice ... (garbled) ... TRON Legacy ... (garbled) ... must find it."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10475              "Guest, who are you? Do you know an Alan Bradley? He works in ... "
