    IDS_DIALOGUE_10489              "Ma3a, I've got it."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10490              "TRON Legacy appears to be an update to the original TRON program. My father stored the code on mainframe EN12-82. Are you familiar with this system?"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10491              "I am, but it's no longer online due to User-activated standby."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10492              "Can we bring it back online?"
