STRINGTABLE DISCARDABLE
BEGIN
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10594              "That's the data port leading to EN12-82."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10595              "The company's old mainframe."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10596              "A Seeker!"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10597              "Ma3a, undock from the protocol socket!"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10598              "The degree to which my code is shared with this system is too extensive. I need more time."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10599              "This should get its attention."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10602              "Whoa!"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10603              "Are they going to press charges?"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10604              "No, I don't believe so. I assured them that your intentions weren't malevolent. Just a misguided youth showing off."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10605              "What were you thinking, Jet? Hacking into the school's mainframe is not only stupid but also illegal."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10606              "I was just bored, Dad. It's no big deal."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10607              "Your mother would be crushed if she were still with us."
