STRINGTABLE DISCARDABLE
BEGIN
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10608              "Please leave Mom out of this."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10609              "Look Jet, you're not taking school seriously, you have no plans for your future-one of these days, reality is going to blindside you and I won't be here to bail you out."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10610              "I don't need your help. Since Mom died, I've taken care of myself just fine."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10611              "Yes, and today was a wonderful example of that.  Jet, wait."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10612              "Please Dad, stop trying to run my life. "
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10613              "I'm not you ... "
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10614              "Hmmm, this script is really banged up."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10615              "Look at that base code, I've never seen anything so complex."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10616              "Are you okay, stranger?"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10617              " "
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10618              "What happened? Who ... are you?"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10619              "The name's I-No. Who might you be?"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10620              "Jet. I'm looking for the TRON Legacy code"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10623              "EN12-82, top-of-the-line mainframe, capable of 16-bit processing, full monochromatic display support and a local storage of 128 megabytes. I challenge you to find a more robust system."
