STRINGTABLE DISCARDABLE
BEGIN
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10624              "What do you do here?"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10625              "I know everything. I'm looked upon as a great asset to this system."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10626              "So, do you know where the TRON Legacy code is?"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10627              "Not precisely. But I'll find it."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10629              "Hmmm-stranger, you're not from around here, are you?"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10630              "I guess you can say I'm from the future. This system has been powered down for a long time."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10631              "The future! I know nothing of the future."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10634              "I've heard rumors about TRON Legacy. Some sort of upgrade to the great TRON program."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10635              "I know TRON retired from use soon after the network became a free system again. Unfortunately, his whereabouts remain unknown ... even to me."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10636              "I came this close to being acquired by the Master Control Program. If it weren't for TRON, I wouldn't know what I know-you know."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10637              "Jet, I've detected another Seeker. I'm not secure here. I must exit the power router."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10638              "There isn't enough processing power to handle you on this system. The Seeker that followed me began to stall the second it came in."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10639              "Excuse me-I know I'm not equal to your superior intellects, but how about over-clocking the system to increase the processing power?"
END

STRINGTABLE DISCARDABLE
BEGIN
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10640              "Excellent idea!"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10642              "I don't know if this system can handle it."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10643              "It's the only option."
