    IDS_DIALOGUE_10645              "Sorry, stranger. That's resource hog territory. Buncha nasty programs with an insatiable appetite for processor calculations. I don't recommend going."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10646              "I don't have any choice."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10647              "Well, good luck to you, then."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10648              "Oh my, the poor script is doomed ... Wait, stranger ... !  I know the way."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10649              "Listen, stranger, I feel bad not extending a warmer reception-you being new to the EN12-82 and all."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10650              "I appreciate the sentiment I-No, but what I need is some help over-clocking the system."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_10651              "Over-clocking! I know of the theory, but I've never seen it done."
