    IDS_DIALOGUE_11298              "Racing team One, enter training grid Alpha."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_11299              "Racing team Two and Three, enter training grid Beta."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_11300              "Racing teams Four, Five, Six and Seven, prepare to enter training grid Gamma."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_11301              "Second unauthorized program detected. Racing teams Six and Seven, divert to training grid Beta."
END

