STRINGTABLE DISCARDABLE
BEGIN
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12501              "Programs Cody, Sk8 and Jet prepare to enter grid arena one."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12505              "To learn how to operate a light cycle, please enter the data stream.  Wait while I open the port."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12506              "First the basics."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12507              "Light cycles travel at a default speed and cannot be stopped."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12508              "To accelerate, press and hold the move forward key. Releasing the key returns the speed back to default speed."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12509              "To decelerate, press and hold the move backward key. Releasing the key returns the speed back to default speed."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12510              "To steer your light cycle, use the right and left strafe keys."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12511              "Use camera zoom and camera rotation keys to control camera position."
END

STRINGTABLE DISCARDABLE
BEGIN
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12512              "Feel free to practice controlling your light cycle."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12514              "It's not uncommon to find power ups on light cycle grids."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12515              "Use the fire button to activate a power up once it is acquired. Note that power ups are only good for one use."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12516              "To pick up a power up, steer your light cycle over the icon."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12518              "When finished, steer your light cycle over the exit icon."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12519              "The objective when on a light cycle is to outlast your opponent without crashing. To win, force your opponent to crash into the trail left behind your light cycle or into some other solid object."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12520              "Feel free to practice racing against these opponents."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12521              "When finished, steer your light cycle over the exit icon."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12524              "Programs scheduled for grid competition are to enter light cycle arena immediately."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12526              "Enter the data stream to start the race."
END

STRINGTABLE DISCARDABLE
BEGIN
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12528              "Follow me."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12530              "Programs Jet, Sim, Frog and Crom prepare to enter grid arena two"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12531              "Sorry, I don't know who will win the next race."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12532              "If you find out the favored, come back and let me know."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12533              "Blue's been training with Mercury - so says the smart money."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12534              "You did real good out there. If properly equipped, I'm betting you can go the distance."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12535              "Take this permission and access the security lockers. I think you'll like what you find in there."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12536              "I've got a lot riding on you program."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12540              "You'd better get going."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12541              "Programs Lan, Jet, TwoD and Mercury prepare to enter grid arena three"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12543              "Is Mercury really that good?"
END

STRINGTABLE DISCARDABLE
BEGIN
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12544              "Is a beta version buggy?  She's the undisputed light cycle champ!"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12545              "Those bikes move in straight lines but somehow Mercury manages to run circles around everyone."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12547              "Impressive racing, keep it up."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12548              "Maybe after the race, you can give me a few pointers."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12549              "Wait -- what am I saying?  After the race, you'll be history!"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12550              "Jet, do as I say and don't ask questions."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12551              "Hurry, and make your way to the far side of the grid arena."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12552              "Escape the arena by using the ramp made of debris. Do it now!"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_12558              "You can take out enemies quietly using the Rod Primitive."
END

