STRINGTABLE DISCARDABLE
BEGIN
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13503              "It's too late. Find a place to stow away."
END

STRINGTABLE DISCARDABLE
BEGIN
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13504              "I hear there's an illegal program on board."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13505              "I hope the transport is not delayed due to the increased ICP activity."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13508              "Where is a good place to stow away?"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13509              "Well, you didn't hear it from me, but you can escape authorization by hiding in the upper network of a Recognizer tug."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13510              "How do you access a Recognizer tug?"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13511              "Head to the back of the transport and climb up. It's as simple as that."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13512              "Hmm, another stowaway.  What's this sector coming to?"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13513              "You can hide up there. Access to the tug is on the upper deck."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13514              "Next time get the correct permissions like the rest of us."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13518              "I've activated the data stream out of here. I suggest you use it before the Kernel figures out there is something wrong."
END

STRINGTABLE DISCARDABLE
BEGIN
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13522              "Jet, secure the area, I need to access the defense protocol socket."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13523              "Reversing the defense protocols will take some time. In the interim, locate the routing oculus and rotate."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13525              "Finally! My replacement has arrived."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13526              "I was supposed to retire 352 microcycles ago."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13527              "Let me show you the ropes."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13528              "This is what rotates the oculus."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13529              "Rotating will route power to system EN12-82. However, that hasn't been done in a long time."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13530              "Over here, we have the panel that configures the router lenses."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13531              "There are two ways to align the lenses. Remotely from this panel, or manually, using the override bits located in the sublevel."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13532              "Well, that's about it. Good luck to ya."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13533              "Return to the Control Tower immediately. The upper deck is being flooded with ICPs. I'm completely vulnerable while docked."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13534              "Hurry!"
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13535              "You'll need to protect me from the ICPs while I finish reversing the defense protocols."
END

STRINGTABLE DISCARDABLE
BEGIN
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13537              "Use the data stream to enter the Control Tower. Eliminate all ICPs that approach our location."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13538              "Good news Mr. Crown."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13539              "We've completed the first phase of training."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13540              "Our DataWraiths are adapting well to the environmental simulators, and the biological stress appears to be minimal."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13541              "The real test now is to see how effective they are against various types of security protocol measures."
    IDS_DIALOGUE_13542              "Should be interesting."
END

